      "taskQuestion": "Which response most effectively prevents sensitive data from remaining exposed to crawlers?",
      "taskCompleteText": "<b>Charisse:</b> Correct. Sensitive files should be removed from public hosting or protected by authorization. robots.txt can guide cooperative indexing, but it is not an access control."
